Z||000004||artherd||06-30-2001||05:10 AM||||I must confess a love anything mid-engined. <P>But man, PINK! :)<P>Still, at least it was a perfectly respectable (and throughly FUN) sports car.<BR>Turbo MR2s start out a very nice car from the factory, and the engine is bomb-proof, it is the same casting I belive as used in toyota's 9,000rpm rally cars.  <P>A bit on the small for my taste, but if someone offered me up an 95 turbo (red is a great colour on these cars) I'd snap it up in a hurry.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
