Z||000006||Mach10||06-30-2001||05:36 PM||||Been there, done that. Guy in a red Gen-II Mr. Two rolls up and starts ogling my ride. We taps his gas, I rev mine. At a yellow, he revvs up high, and the pop-offs go. Neat sound. At the green, smoke and taillights. Clean kill, no show-boating or hotdogging afterwards.||||reg||7
Z||000007||88formula||07-01-2001||09:16 AM||||Not only does the MR2 handle but the turbocharged one's are quick, of course that’s until they meet a v8 or supercharged/turbocharged fiero. Than the MR2 guy will see Pontiac lights and the fiero emblem through the tire smoke, some even say 2m8 in the back. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
