Z||000012||Tonker||07-02-2001||09:37 PM||||I've gotta say, I can certainly appreciate the MR2, particularly the mk.II's. My friend has a mk.I (non-supercharged) and we've agreed that once he gets his out for the summer we're gonna have a go at it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>We've also agreed to swap rides so we can see how they differ in terms of drive. I think he's getting the better deal here, but you've gotta take pity the poor guy, right? I mean how else will he learn the error of his ways?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
